Jacobi 关系

\spadcommand{Jacobi(p: Lpoly, q: Lpoly, r: Lpoly): Lpoly == [ [p,q]\$Lpoly, r] + [ [q,r]\$Lpoly, p] + [ [r,p]\$Lpoly, q]  }
