{\sqrt {{{2 \  {\sqrt {{-{{10} \  {\sqrt {{29}}}}+{55}}}}} -
{2 \  {\sqrt {{29}}}}+
{16}}}}=
{-{\sqrt {{{2 \  {\sqrt {{29}}}}+{11}}}}+
{\sqrt {{{2 \  {\sqrt {5}}}+
{22}}}}+{\sqrt {5}}} 
