{\sqrt {{{{\left( {{34} \  {\sqrt {2}}}+{46} 
\right)}
\  {\sqrt {5}}}+{{70} \  {\sqrt {2}}}+{112}}}}={{{\left( {\sqrt {2}}+3 
\right)}
\  {\sqrt {5}}}+{4 \  {\sqrt {2}}}+5} 
