arctangent of \smath{x}.
\newitem\smath{\mbox{\bf atan}\opLeftPren{}x, \allowbreak{} y\opRightPren{}} 
computes the arc tangent from \smath{x}
with phase \smath{y}.
\newitem\smath{\mbox{\bf atanIfCan}\opLeftPren{}x\opRightPren{}} 
