returns a basis of the centroid of
\smath{R}, that is, the endomorphism ring of \smath{R} considered as
\smath{(R, R)}-bimodule.
Domain \smath{R} is a domain of category
\axiomType{FramedNonAssociativeAlgebra}.
}

