\opdata{{\mbox{\axiomFun{lhs}}\opLeftPren{}
{\it equationOrRewriteRule}\opRightPren{}%
}%
}%
{1}{(\$)->F}{RewriteRule}
{\smath{\mbox{\bf lhs}\opLeftPren{}x\opRightPren{}} 
returns the left hand side of an equation or rewrite-rule.
}

