{2}{(\$, NonNegativeInteger)->Boolean}{Aggregate}
{\smath{\mbox{\bf more?}\opLeftPren{}u, \allowbreak{} n\opRightPren{}}
tests if \smath{u} has greater than \smath{n} elements.
}

